1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,995
Pink Shell Beach Resort. Let's count what
you get.

2
00:00:03,695 --> 00:00:06,749
One hundred ninety five rooms, with a
balcony in the studio.

3
00:00:07,399 --> 00:00:09,376
Three pools, right on the beach.

4
00:00:10,026 --> 00:00:12,529
Three restaurants, from lunch to Italian.

5
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:15,012
Three bars, one on the sand.

6
00:00:15,662 --> 00:00:16,443
Two hot tubs.

7
00:00:17,093 --> 00:00:19,509
Fourteen hundred and ninety four reviews.

8
00:00:20,159 --> 00:00:22,555
Nine point four out of ten, from real
guests.

9
00:00:23,405 --> 00:00:28,834
The verdict. Three strengths: it's very
clean, the location is great, and kids
love it.

10
00:00:29,334 --> 00:00:34,702
Three weak spots: the resort fee, tight
parking, and construction noise.

11
00:00:35,202 --> 00:00:39,397
Worth it? Yes, for beach lovers who check
the total. Eight out of ten.
